<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - H&amp;Q raises Pairgain est.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - H&amp;Q raises Pairgain est.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist raised Q2 estimates on Pairgain Technologies Inc to $0.20/shr from $0.18 and raised revenues estimates to $77.2 million from $75.6 million.</p>
<p>-- Maintain buy rating.</p>
</text>
